			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Fixed FOV and music delay sliders in options menu\n* Added cloud style toggle in options menu\n* Fixed cherries not showing up in spring worlds\n* Added bottomless water buckets made using water buckets and 4 aquamarine\n* Made sponges craftable using aquamarine and 4 coral.\n* Increased world name length limit\n* Improved armour system\n  * Different armours now provide different amounts of protection at full durability\n  * Armours degrade at different rates depending on tier.\n  * Increased the durability of armour overall.\n\n## Files Provided\n* `Alpha.Advanced.v1.5.2.zip`: MultiMC Instance\n* `AA.v1.5.2.jar`: Jarmod"
