			"notes": "## What's Changed\n* Added Spring Worlds\n   * Spring worlds generate with pink cherry-blossom leaves \n   * Spring worlds generate with a more saturated grass colour\n   * Flowers are more common in spring worlds\n   * Apples are replaced with cherries in spring worlds\n* Ocean Changes\n   * Added naturally generating coral formations\n   * Added Azure, a stone variant that rarely spawns in and around water\n   * Added Aquamarine, a rare gem that spawns in Azure formations.\n* World Creation changes\n   * Added a 'Random' option to the season selection\n   * Fixed numerous bugs with seed entry\n   * Added the ability to name new worlds\n* Greatly improved clouds\n* Added 3 new paintings: \"Home From Afar\", \"Town Center\" and \"Sunset in Spring\"\n* Improved tools\n   * Wood, Stone, Iron, Gold & Diamond tools had durability buffed\n   * Copper tools had efficiency buffed, but durability was not buffed.\n\n## Files Provided\n* `Alpha.Advanced.v1.5.0.zip`: Full MultiMC Instance\n* `AA.v1.5.0.jar`: Alpha Advanced Jarmod"
		},
